<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com\/siyaset","name":"Siyaset"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com\/yeni-partide-onsecim-itirazina-ret-karari","name":"Yeni Parti'de \u00f6nse\u00e7im itiraz\u0131na ret karar\u0131"}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Yeni Parti'de \u00f6nse\u00e7im itiraz\u0131na ret karar\u0131","articleSection":"Siyaset","dateCreated":"2026-09-30T18:06:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-09-30T18:06:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-22T12:53:34+03:00","wordCount":273,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com\/yeni-partide-onsecim-itirazina-ret-karari"},"articleBody":"Ana muhalefet partisi konumuna y\u00fckselen Yeni Parti, Ayd\u0131n'daki \u00f6rg\u00fctlenme \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131 il kongresi \u00f6ncesi h\u0131zland\u0131rd\u0131. Baz\u0131 il\u00e7elerde kongre s\u00fcrecine girilirken, baz\u0131 il\u00e7elerde ise ba\u015fkanl\u0131k i\u00e7in \u00f6nse\u00e7im heyecan\u0131 ya\u015fan\u0131yor. Bu kapsamda 19 May\u0131s D\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn Salonu\u2019nda ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen Germencik \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6nse\u00e7iminde oylamay\u0131 \u0130brahim G\u00fcl \u00f6nde tamamlad\u0131.\r\n\r\nBA\u015eKAN ADAYINDAN \"USULS\u00dcZL\u00dcK\" \u0130T\u0130RAZI\r\n\r\n26 Eyl\u00fcl'de yap\u0131lan \u00f6nse\u00e7imin ard\u0131ndan di\u011fer aday Nazike Cengi, sonu\u00e7lara itiraz ederek s\u00fcreci Genel Merkez'e ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131. Cengi dilek\u00e7esinde, sand\u0131kta 406 se\u00e7menin oy kullanmas\u0131na ra\u011fmen resmi say\u0131n\u0131n 403 olarak duyuruldu\u011funu ve hazirun listesinde ad\u0131 bulunmayan bir ki\u015finin oy kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6ne s\u00fcrd\u00fc.\r\n\r\nGENEL MERKEZ \u0130NCELED\u0130: \u0130DD\u0130ALAR HAVADA KALDI\r\n\r\nYeni Parti Genel Merkezi taraf\u0131ndan \u00f6nse\u00e7im birle\u015ftirme tutanaklar\u0131 ve hazirun listeleri \u00fczerinde yap\u0131lan detayl\u0131 incelemede, oy kullanan se\u00e7men say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n tutanaklara 406 olarak do\u011fru \u015fekilde i\u015flendi\u011fi ve imza say\u0131s\u0131yla uyu\u015ftu\u011fu tespit edildi.\r\n\r\nAyr\u0131ca, d\u0131\u015far\u0131dan oy kulland\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 iddia edilen ki\u015finin soyad\u0131n\u0131n Cengi'nin itiraz dilek\u00e7esinde hatal\u0131 yaz\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131, s\u00f6z konusu se\u00e7menin do\u011fru kimlik bilgileriyle listede resmi olarak kay\u0131tl\u0131 bulundu\u011fu saptand\u0131.\r\n\r\nYap\u0131lan de\u011ferlendirmeler sonucunda, ileri s\u00fcr\u00fclen iddialar\u0131n t\u00fcz\u00fck, y\u00f6nerge ve genelgelere ayk\u0131r\u0131l\u0131k te\u015fkil etmedi\u011fine karar veren Genel Merkez, itiraz\u0131 kesin olarak reddetti. Al\u0131nan bu kararla birlikte \u0130brahim G\u00fcl\u2019\u00fcn Germencik \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 tescillenmi\u015f oldu.","description":"Cumhuriyet Halk Partisi\u2019ne (CHP) getirilen butlan karar\u0131n\u0131n ard\u0131ndan \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel liderli\u011finde 91 milletvekiliyle kurulan Yeni Parti'de, Germencik \u0130l\u00e7e\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/aydintimescom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/aydintimes-com\/uploads\/2026\/09\/yeni-parti-germencikte-usulsuzluk-krizi-baskan-adayi-cenginin-iddialari-asilsiz-cikti.webp","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Yeni Parti'de \u00f6nse\u00e7im itiraz\u0131na ret karar\u0131"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com\/#organization","name":"Ayd\u0131n Times \u2013 Ayd\u0131n ve T\u00fcrkiye\u2019den Son Dakika Haberleri","image":"https:\/\/aydintimescom.teimg.com\/aydintimes-com\/uploads\/2026\/03\/aydin-times-logo-1.svg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/aydintimescom.teimg.com\/aydintimes-com\/uploads\/2026\/03\/aydin-times-logo-1.svg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Haber Merkezi","url":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com\/muhabir\/5\/haber-merkezi"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Haber Merkezi","url":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com\/muhabir\/5\/haber-merkezi"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com\/#organization","name":"Ayd\u0131n Times \u2013 Ayd\u0131n ve T\u00fcrkiye\u2019den Son Dakika Haberleri","url":"https:\/\/www.aydintimes.com"}}</script>


